- 记录操作日志。

```java
public static void createFile(Scanner scanner) {
    if (!AuthService.isLoggedIn()) return; // 检查是否已登录

    String filename = InputUtils.getStringInput(scanner, "输入文件名: ");
    String content = InputUtils.getStringInput(scanner, "输入内容: ");

    if (filename.isEmpty() || content.isEmpty()) {
        System.out.println("文件名和内容不能为空！");
        return;
    }

    Path userFileDir = Paths.get(Constants.FILES_FOLDER, AuthService.getCurrentUser());
    Path filePath = userFileDir.resolve(filename);

    try {
        Files.createDirectories(userFileDir); // 确保用户目录存在
        if (Files.exists(filePath)) {
            System.out.println("文件已存在！");
            return;
        }

        Files.write(filePath, content.getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8));

        // 初始化权限：所有者默认拥有读写权限
        PermissionManager.initFilePermissions(filename, AuthService.getCurrentUser());

        FileOperationLog.log("CREATE_FILE", "SUCCESS", 
            "用户 " + AuthService.getCurrentUser() + " 创建文件: " + filename);
        System.out.println("文件创建成功！");
    } catch (IOException e) {
        System.out.println("文件创建失败: " + e.getMessage());
        FileOperationLog.log("CREATE_FILE", "FAILED", 
            "错误: " + e.getMessage());
    }
}
```

