## 实验原理总结

### 1. 作业调度的主要任务

**核心任务：**
- **进程选择**：从就绪队列中选择合适的进程投入运行
- **CPU分配**：合理分配CPU时间给各个进程
- **系统效率**：提高CPU利用率和系统吞吐量
- **公平性**：保证每个进程都能获得合理的CPU时间
- **响应时间**：减少用户交互的等待时间

### 2. 常见进程调度算法

## 实验内容实现

### 数据结构定义

```c
#include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>
#include <string.h>

#define MAX_PROCESS 10

// 进程控制块(PCB)
typedef struct {
    int pid;           // 进程ID
    char name[20];     // 进程名
    int arrival_time;  // 到达时间
    int burst_time;    // 运行时间
    int priority;      // 优先级
    int start_time;    // 开始时间
    int finish_time;   // 完成时间
    int waiting_time;  // 等待时间
    int turnaround_time; // 周转时间
    int remaining_time; // 剩余运行时间(用于轮转调度)
} PCB;
```

### 1. 先来先服务(FCFS)算法

**原理**：按照进程到达就绪队列的顺序进行调度

```c
void FCFS(PCB processes[], int n) {
    // 按到达时间排序
    for (int i = 0; i < n-1; i++) {
        for (int j = 0; j < n-i-1; j++) {
            if (processes[j].arrival_time > processes[j+1].arrival_time) {
                PCB temp = processes[j];
                processes[j] = processes[j+1];
                processes[j+1] = temp;
            }
        }
    }

    int current_time = 0;
    float total_waiting = 0, total_turnaround = 0;

    printf("\n=== FCFS调度过程 ===\n");
    printf("PID\t名称\t到达\t运行\t开始\t完成\t等待\t周转\n");

    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        if (current_time < processes[i].arrival_time) {
            current_time = processes[i].arrival_time;
        }

        processes[i].start_time = current_time;
        processes[i].finish_time = current_time + processes[i].burst_time;
        processes[i].waiting_time = processes[i].start_time - processes[i].arrival_time;
        processes[i].turnaround_time = processes[i].finish_time - processes[i].arrival_time;

        total_waiting += processes[i].waiting_time;
        total_turnaround += processes[i].turnaround_time;

        printf("%d\t%s\t%d\t%d\t%d\t%d\t%d\t%d\n",
               processes[i].pid, processes[i].name, processes[i].arrival_time,
               processes[i].burst_time, processes[i].start_time, processes[i].finish_time,
               processes[i].waiting_time, processes[i].turnaround_time);

        current_time = processes[i].finish_time;
    }

    printf("\n平均等待时间: %.2f\n", total_waiting/n);
    printf("平均周转时间: %.2f\n", total_turnaround/n);
}
```

### 2. 短作业优先(SJF)算法

**原理**：优先调度运行时间最短的进程

```c
void SJF(PCB processes[], int n) {
    int completed = 0, current_time = 0;
    int completed_flag[MAX_PROCESS] = {0};
    float total_waiting = 0, total_turnaround = 0;

    printf("\n=== SJF调度过程 ===\n");
    printf("PID\t名称\t到达\t运行\t开始\t完成\t等待\t周转\n");

    while (completed < n) {
        int shortest = -1;
        int min_burst = 9999;

        // 找出当前已到达且未完成的进程中运行时间最短的
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
            if (!completed_flag[i] && processes[i].arrival_time <= current_time) {
                if (processes[i].burst_time < min_burst) {
                    min_burst = processes[i].burst_time;
                    shortest = i;
                }
            }
        }

        if (shortest == -1) {
            current_time++;
            continue;
        }

        processes[shortest].start_time = current_time;
        processes[shortest].finish_time = current_time + processes[shortest].burst_time;
        processes[shortest].waiting_time = processes[shortest].start_time - processes[shortest].arrival_time;
        processes[shortest].turnaround_time = processes[shortest].finish_time - processes[shortest].arrival_time;

        total_waiting += processes[shortest].waiting_time;
        total_turnaround += processes[shortest].turnaround_time;

        printf("%d\t%s\t%d\t%d\t%d\t%d\t%d\t%d\n",
               processes[shortest].pid, processes[shortest].name, 
               processes[shortest].arrival_time, processes[shortest].burst_time,
               processes[shortest].start_time, processes[shortest].finish_time,
               processes[shortest].waiting_time, processes[shortest].turnaround_time);

        current_time = processes[shortest].finish_time;
        completed_flag[shortest] = 1;
        completed++;
    }

    printf("\n平均等待时间: %.2f\n", total_waiting/n);
    printf("平均周转时间: %.2f\n", total_turnaround/n);
}
```

