## 三、多继承 (基类 + 多个接口)

### 3.1 类定义

```c
interface Runnable {
    void run();
    void stop();
}

interface Serializable {
    void serialize(Buffer* buf);
    void deserialize(Buffer* buf);
}

class Animal {
    int age;
    virtual void speak();
}

class Dog extends Animal implements Runnable, Serializable {
    int legs;
    override void speak();
    void run() override;
    void stop() override;
    void serialize(Buffer* buf) override;
    void deserialize(Buffer* buf) override;
    virtual void bark();
}
```

